Exotankers! 

Time does not stand still, and the developers are ready to please players with new changes. Now it's even more interesting to conquer the Red Planet.

It's time to get acquainted with the changes in the game:

- Microcircuits have been added in response to the wishes of players who cared to make changes to their equipment.

This configuration element is a passive built-in tank amplifier. 1 chip changes 1 numeric value. 
Each tank has 18 chips (most of which are unique and tied to the mechanics of a particular tank). 
In terms of balance, all chips are equal to each other and cost the same. At the first level of the tank player is given the opportunity to learn any 4 microchips for free. 
To learn the next chip, you need to raise the level of the tank and buy a chip (for Ares or Credits). You can learn chips in any order.
 Any 3 unlocked chips can be used to make a configuration, name it, and use it in a match. On the draft screen, the player can choose which configuration on a given tank he wants to use in a specific match or set one as the default configuration in the hangar. Configurations of all players who participated in the match are visible on the additional tab with the same name in the stats screen after the match.

- Added levels of tanks. 

Now each tank has its own experience scale, by pumping which you can raise the level. Every several levels of a tank gives it a certain rank, which is shown with a special medal (glass, bronze, silver, gold, platinum) on all game screens.

- Changed modifications (equipment): 

1.	Introduced alternative modifications on ranks 3 and 5, increasing damage (previously there were only those that increase the strength of the tank).
2.	 There is a 6th rank which automatically learns all possible modifications on the tank.
- Finished and improved mechanics of daily tasks.
3.	All tasks are now displayed in a certain color which corresponds to its difficulty and reward. (Grey - normal task, Green - unusual task, Blue - rare task, Purple - exotic task). 
4.	Rewards for Green and Blue quests increased by 50 credits. The cost of all quests is now (100, 200, 300, 400 credits).
5.	Changed awards for redoing (instead of 1/5 for primary redoing the task player will get 1/2 value, for secondary redoing - 1/4 of the usual value of the award).

- New skins have been added for all those who appreciate beauty and whose tanks always have a stunning appearance. 

The choice becomes more: 41 rare camouflage on 4 themes: 
1. alternate factory;
2. woodland;
2.	Matte;
3.	Platinum.

- Conducted basic changes to the tanks. Some indicators have been redesigned (slightly weakened in the initial stage of the match, due to the strengthening of modifications and the addition of chips).

1. Diablo:
	- Base speed = 60 km/h;
	- Base turret rotation speed = 270 g/s;
	- Seismic blast now physical damage;
	- Impulse ammo reload time = 35;
	- Base Strength Recovery = 1.2 hp/s;
	- Shot distance = 280 m;
	- Aft armor = 10 mm.

2. Saboteur: 
	- Adaptive camouflage is now reset if tank takes damage; 
	- Shock trap radius = 15 m;
	- Shock Trap Time = 4.5s;
	- Time of action of adaptive camouflage now = 10 sec;
	- Adaptive camouflage recharge time = 35 s;
	- Magnetic mine reload time = 35 s;
	- Magnetic mine life time = 120 s;
	- Impulse bomb reload time = 70 s;
	- Impulse bomb activation time = 7 s;
	- Movement speed = 85 km/h;
	- Turret turning speed = 180 g/s;
	- Aft armor = 10 mm.

3. Dragon: 
	- Fuel spill time = 3.5 s;
	- Fuel spill radius = 20 s;
	- Recovery time from Energy Converter ability = 4s; 
	- Damage time for recovery effect from Energy Converter ability = 4s;
	- Time of Pyrocatron action (puddle existence) = 8s; 
	- Radius of action of mined cylinder = 40 m;
	- Aft armor = 10 mm.

4. Cyborg: 
	- Base main gun reload time = 4s;
       - Base Cyberattack COD = 35 s;
	- Virtualization Time = 8 s;
	- Aft Armor = 10mm.

5. Blade: 
	- Aft armor = 10mm.

6. Mechanic: 
	- Repair Droid Distance = 300 m; 
	- Time of action of Repair Droid = 8 s;
	- Saboteur Droid Distance = 300 m;
	- Recharge time of Self-Repair ability = 65 seconds;
	- Time of action of Self-Repair ability = 8s;
	- Aft Armor = 10mm.

7. Old Man: 
	- Shot damage = 50;
	- Reload time of the Charge Armor ability = 24 s;
	- Reload time of Fire to undercarriage ability = 22 s;
	- Fire undercarriage action time = 6 seconds;
	- Reload time Full Ahead = 55 sec; 
	- Base Strength Recovery = 3 xp/s.

8. Guardian: 
	- Gun Reload Time = 4.5s;
	- Turret Action Time = 55 s;
	- Turret Reload Time = 65 s;
	- Nano-armor reload time = 35 s;
	- Aft Armor = 50 mm;
	- Base Strength Recovery = 2 xp/s.
	- Forcefield Radius = 22.5 m (diameter = 45 m).

9. Timeshifter: 
	- Frontal armor = 70 mm; 
	- Stern armor = 40 mm;
	- Aft armor = 20 mm;
	- Turret Speed = 240 g/s;
	- Base Strength = 350;
	- Reload time of Jerk ability = 18 s;
	- Sniper mode added.

10. Tesla: 
	- Base movement speed = 80 km/h;
	- Damage to Grounding ability = 70;
	- Earthing cooldown time = 35;
	- Base Strength Recovery = 1/s;
	- Aft Armor = 10mm.

11. Storm: 
	- Base movement speed = 65 km/h;
	- Instant recharge ability cast (use) time - 3 seconds;
	- Instant Recharge ability cooldown time = 35 sec;
	- Overcharge time for Defensive Mode ability = 45 seconds;
	- Defensive Mode ability activation time = 5 seconds;
	- Time to activate (delay before use) for Defensive Mode = 1.5 seconds;
	- Base toughness regeneration = 2 xp/s;
	- Damage per Missile = 23;
	- Fuel Injection ability cooldown time = 35 sec;
	- Fuel Injection action time = 5;
	- Reload time multipurpose mode = 70s.

- Changed most of all tank modifications and added new ones. 

See you on the Martian battlefields!

Exotankers! 

There have been changes on the Red Planet. Ready to roll your tanks out onto the Martian battlefield? 

Daily missions are getting even more interesting:

- A new type of daily tasks has been added that requires a victory in 1 match. The total number of tasks is 12+ (+1 task for each tank that is not a base tank). The cost of reward is 100 credits if this is the first completed task of the day, 20 credits if it is repeated;
- Now if you complete all tasks at each difficulty level, the next day tasks of all difficulty levels are added at once (not 1, as before); 
- Task "Put any emblem on any tank" moved to the section "Difficult". Reward for completing it was changed to 400 credits for the first task per day and 80 credits for the second task.

This is not the end of the changes. To make the game even more interesting for all players, we have added achievements. 

- At the moment, there are 16 initial achievements. All of them are hidden until they are completed. When completing all of the achievements, the player will receive a gift.

Also added to the game penalties for inactivity:

- A player is considered inactive if he does not receive combat experience for 4+2 minutes. A player who is considered inactive does not receive an award for the match.

Do you like to decorate your tanks? Is standing out from the crowd as important to you as winning? Then the following news will make you happy.

- The prices of Wing 1, Wing 2, Wing 3 and Beast Wing emblems have been changed. Prices have been reduced to 1125 Credits/25 Ares from 2250 Credits/50 Ares; 
- All emblems sold only for Ares have been raised from 20 to 30 battles; 
- Added community text emblems for sale:
● Iron Heart;
● Press "F"; 
● Unbreakable; 
● For Mars! 
● I love EXOTANKS.


Minor Changes:

- Added grid of tanks classification by roles in Hangar;
- Added possibility to zoom out the camera in battle (on the mouse wheel);
- Reduced recovery time of tanks after death for "Capture" and "Death Battle" modes. Recovery time = X*7 seconds, where X - tank level;
- Fixed collisions in locations. Potential number of stuck tank locations reduced.

Fixed critical bugs and errors.

See you in battles!

Exotankers!

There's been a change at Red Planet! Hurry to open the news to see the main details of the update.

[img]https://i.ibb.co/hWS7qbK/image001.jpg[/img]

Have you already had time to explore all the open locations on Mars?

Then meet "Furrin - the first deposit".

Furrin is a place shrouded in darkness. It holds the history: Ares was found here, the original source of all new age technical achievements and the cause of the first Martian War. Furrin was the place that opened the beginning of the great colonial mission.

Do you like communication? Is coordinating your allies important to you? Then the following changes are for you.

Combat Chat

- Chat for allies (enter) and general (/);
- Gameplay messages are now displayed in chat;
- Option to disable chat and gameplay messages.

Spending time in the game is more interesting by completing daily tasks.

- 11 daily tasks;
- Changed mechanics of auto-replenishment of tasks: after completing a task there is a new one with a smaller reward;
- Mechanic of replacement of tasks after their completion (replacement cost = 1/5 of the cost of the award);

Given the requests of the players, we rebalanced the tanks:

Old Man:

- Increased total HP (from 450 to 500);
- Increased the effect time "Stop" from the ability "Fire in undercarriage" (from 6 to 7);
- Reduced cooldown time of Full Ahead ability (from 60 to 50).

Timeshifter:

- Increased the amount of ammo in a clip (from 12 to 18);
- Decreased reload time of main weapon (from 12 to 10);
- Changed the duration of the "Acceleration" effect from the ability "Contour acceleration" (from 6 to 8), the effect "Damage increased" (from 3 to 4), reload (from 18 to 20);
- Increased the reduction time of the skill "Stopping Time" from the talent "Temporal Connection" (from 2 to 3);
- Changed the talent "Improved Jerk" (now gives 2 ability charges).

Work was done to optimize the game for weak PC.

Completing missions on Mars is more exciting in tactically clever battles. Now your battles in Death match mode will become much more exciting.

- Control points are unavailable for capture for up to 7 minutes. It's time to think through your battle tactics and show who is the true defender of Mars.

For us the opinion of players is important, that's why changes were made to the economy of the game.

- Reduced prices for the first tank (to 400 Ares or 18.000 credits) and increased for the next tanks (to 900 Ares and 40500 credits);
- Changed awards for battles (in credits), daily tasks and referral system;
- Changed awards for level ups: in addition to Ares now give credits (every fifth level - Ares + credits, the rest - only credits);
- Boosters are now available for daily tasks;
- Changed the size of sets of Ares in the store.

We made changes to the advanced settings to ensure a comfortable gaming experience.

- There is an ability to invert mouse X and Y in sensitivity settings.
Also changed the battle UI:
- The tank progression branch within the battle has been moved from the left edge of the screen to the right;
- FPS and Ping moved from lower right edge to upper right edge;
- Now there is a display of current tank's speed (in km/h and miles/h) in UI;
- Changed the mechanics of entering combat. Now everyone who pressed "accept" is allowed into the battle, regardless of those who did not have time.

Fixed a number of bugs and errors.

We look forward to seeing you on the battlefields of Mars!

[b]Hello, Exotankers! [/b]

We're proud and happy to announce, that our new update is close to its release.  At the edge of autumn months a plesant surprise is waiting for you. Alright, without futher ado, we'd like to start. 

[b]New map! [/b]
[img]https://i.ibb.co/93VcFjF/industry-zone-1600-900.jpg[/img]
New map: "Kvirin - industrial complex" is now available in the game. This region greatly fits into general game entourage. On grim nooks of the complex there are no voices, only total silence. Hangars are now moody guardians of the local peace. But permanent silence was interrupted by the Domitnator crash. 
Now - this location is a place of numerous confrontations, cause Kvirin's recource base is narrowed under the earth. Though industrial complex is famous for its great views, so you'll always have something to look at. 
[b]
Tanks rework[/b]

All the team has thought about rework of several machines. And as a result we can see, that all 8 steel monsters were changed. 
List of changes is below: 
[b]All the tanks: [/b]
•	Numerous changes of tank's parameters and abilities. Tanks balancing process is now in process. 
•	Now all abilities apply "effects" on allies and enemies. For example "Mechanic" can apply an effect of HP restorage using his drone. 
•	It's impossible to apply similar effects for one machine. As an example: if you're paralized an enemy with the Saboteur "Shock trap" Cyborg's "Cyberattack" (that also paralize an enemy) - will only a little bit prolong this effect. 
[b]Saboteur[/b]
•	Saboteur is now aims in enemies as all other machines. So it becomes easier to shoot; 
•	Magnetic mine activates during 10 sec after appearance;
•	Invisibility became more reliable, but your tank can be damaged even when you're invisible, and drop mines with bombs;
•	Were changed several abilities that tank gains during the battle. Now Saboteur is able to place 2 mines instead of 1 and "Shock trap" deals damage; 
[b]Storm [/b]
•	New ability "Defence mode" allows to defence yourself in critical situations;
•	Ultimative ability "Multipurpose regime" is now automatically releases a huge number of rockets in several enemies; 
•	Were changed several abilities that tank gains during the battle. You'll be able to upgrade such abilites, as: "Fuel injection" and "Defense mode";
[b]Diablo [/b]
•	Were changed several abilities that tank gains during the battle. You'll be able to upgrade such ability as "Seismic strike"; 
[b]Cyborg [/b]
•	Were changed several abilities that tank gains during the battle. From on now you're able to place observer trackers;
[b]Guardian [/b]
•	Were changed several abilities that tank gains during the battle. From on now you're able to place 2 turrets instead of 1;

[b]Battle and loading screens changings[/b]

Also modifications were made to the standard Battle and Loading screens. Now it looks more solid and stylish. 
[b]
Battle screen changes [/b]

•	Now damage marker shows which armour was hitted with color;
•	Also, on the tank's icon at the bottom of the screen is now shown which armour was hitted; 
•	On the battle screen is now shown drones HP level and their appearance time; 
•	Abilities panel was upgraded and edited; 
•	Was changed the HP and distance information displaying (it's written above the tanks);
•	Was changed the look of tank's level up table; 
•	Now pressing F2 you're able to open the table with abilities information; 

[b]Loading screen changes [/b]

•	This screen was entirely redesigned; 
•	Now leagues and avatars information is shown on this screen; 
•	Now a hint with game rules, map and regime name is shown on this screen; 

[b]Fixed bugs [/b]

A list of bugs were fixed. They affected the speed and perfomance of player's machines during the game.

•	Was fixed problem connected with Sabouter ultimative ability;  
•	In game there will be no invisible walls; 
•	Now it's possible to create a group of 5 players; 
[b]
Will be happy to see you on Martian battlefields. [/b]

- Redesigned a number of the user interfaces: battle screen, draft screen, ares store, settings screen;

- Redesigned J02 MECHANIC and GND DRAGON tanks;

- R5-256 TESLA tank is now available for players;

- The long range sights (sniper scope) became the ability of individual tanks: F20 GUARDIAN, R570 CYBORG, J02 MECHANIC;

- Introduced rating and league system. Now each player to measure his rating and the rating of a teammate ;)

- Introduced the portraits (avatar) of players. The players with a unique avatar in the access pack have already received them and now you will always recognize our Officers and Founders.

- Changes in the balance of tanks;

- Fixed a number of bugs related to the interaction of players in the group.

- Fixing bugs in the friends system;

- Fixing shooting bugs and skills;

- Bug fixes with force barriers on player bases;

- Fixed a number of bugs that caused not all players to see the Battle results window;

- Fixed tank physics;

- Fixed bugs in the network part of the game;

- Improved stability of the server part of the ExoTanks platform;

- Updated visual effects of drones;
- Changes in game scenarios, now there will be a real massacre for the Key Points;


- New players will no longer be able to connect to the battle if it's already over 5 minutes. They will only be able to join the new battle;

- Drone modifications: Drone spawned on the 5th minute of the game, drone respawn on the 3rd minute, increased HP to 1200, increased experience for killing drone (there were 450 drones now 600), key point capture speed increased 4 times (equivalent of 4 tanks on the key point earlier), notifications about allied and enemy drones appearing/death/spawn.

- The game's final user interface has begun to be implemented;

Recently, some players have experienced problems with authorization and some actions in the game. This update fixes some problems with the network part of the game. Now there is nothing stopping you from exploding a couple of enemies in the evening. 

- Fixed the functionality of friends and groups;
- Fixed bug inviting to a filled group;
- Fixed display of friends list;
- Fixed an error that sometimes appeared when closing a client;
- Fixed display of strength recovery on an F20 Guardian tank with resuscitation equipment;
- Fixed camouflage loss after leaving invisibility on FS189 Saboteur;
- Fixed display of level up window;
- Fixed draft problems if a part of players do not confirm their readiness for a match;
- Fixed lounge hangs;
- Fixed visual display of key point capture;
- Fixed bug with transition to another region and player profile hangs;
- Fixed bug with game currency display;
- On the statistics screen, you can now add to your friends;
- Fixed overlay mode for different versions of the game;
- Fixed a number of fixes for the game server part. 

A lot has been done, more to come, but we're going to fight against the bugs!

- The implementation of the new network platform ExoTanks;
- The implementation of the new game interface;
- New skins for J02 Mechanic and GND Dragon tanks;
- Improvements to bots AI;
- Improve the lighting in the hangar;
- Game content optimization; 
- Fixes a lot of bugs.

- New early access packages have been introduced in Steam;
- The lighting adjustments in the player's hangar;
- Added new camouflages for tanks;
- Updated Launcher and Updater, bug fixes;
- Improved bots AI;
- Other bug fixes.

- Added a reward in the form of experience and credits for the fight, the reward of arrest for raising the level.
- Added in-game store;
- Added tank appearance window for camouflage and emblem placement;
- Added ability to buy tanks from a hangar;
- Added ability to select tank camouflages;
- Added ability to select tank stickers and their color;
- The GND Dragon tank is now available for purchase;
- Upgraded artificial bot intelligence;
- Optimized a huge amount of game content;
- Interface bug fixes;
- Fixing download errors in the lounge and optimizing its operation (it is necessary to run the game installer again, over the current version);
- Other bug fixes.

Update 4592

- Fixed Matchmaking issues;
- Fixed a lot of UI bugs; 
- New UI and sounds for draft window;
- Improved bots AI;
- Optimized some server-side player packet verifications;
- Some client-side performance improvements;

Update 4569


- Fixed bugs associated with joining the battle;
- Added primitive bots to warming up players between battles;
- There are no restrictions on the number of players to start a battle;
- Fixed a number of other bugs.
